{"zh":[{"start":12.46,"end":16.48,"text":"旁白：平均每一两天，卫星就会探测到"},{"start":16.5,"end":20.55,"text":"天空某处的一次大爆炸。这就是伽马射线"},{"start":20.57,"end":24.62,"text":"暴，宇宙中最亮的爆发。人们认为它们"},{"start":24.64,"end":28.69,"text":"是由接近光速运动的物质喷流造成的，和"},{"start":28.71,"end":32.75,"text":"黑洞的诞生有关。持续超过两秒的伽马射线暴"},{"start":32.77,"end":36.83,"text":"最常见，人们认为它们来自大质量恒星的死亡。"},{"start":36.85,"end":41.04,"text":"较短的暴则难以捉摸得多。事实上，"},{"start":41.06,"end":45.06,"text":"甚至它们的一些基本性质都不为人知，直到 NASA 的雨燕卫星"},{"start":45.08,"end":49.16,"text":"2004 年开始工作。天文学家怀疑，相撞的"},{"start":49.18,"end":53.21,"text":"中子星可以解释短暴。"},{"start":53.23,"end":57.31,"text":"中子星是质量为太阳几倍的恒星"},{"start":57.33,"end":61.39,"text":"坍缩爆炸后剩下的东西。超过太阳的"},{"start":61.41,"end":65.43,"text":"质量被压进一个直径不到 18 英里的球体里，这些天体"},{"start":65.45,"end":69.51,"text":"密度高得惊人。仅仅方糖大小的一块中子星物质，"},{"start":69.53,"end":73.56,"text":"就能和五大湖里所有的水一样重。当两颗"},{"start":73.58,"end":77.66,"text":"互相绕转的中子星相撞时，它们会合并成一个黑洞，释放出"},{"start":77.68,"end":81.68,"text":"巨大的能量。借助最先进的"},{"start":81.7,"end":85.7,"text":"超级计算机模型，科学家证明了相撞的中子星"},{"start":85.72,"end":89.76,"text":"能产生伽马射线暴所需的高能喷流。"},{"start":89.78,"end":93.83,"text":"早先的模拟证明合并能产生黑洞。另一些"},{"start":93.85,"end":97.91,"text":"则证明，产生伽马射线暴所需的高速粒子喷流"},{"start":97.93,"end":101.96,"text":"放在刚合并完的旋转残骸里也能持续下去。"},{"start":101.98,"end":106.0,"text":"现在，模拟揭示了这个过程的中间一步"},{"start":106.02,"end":110.07,"text":"——合并中的恒星的磁场如何自己组织起来，"},{"start":110.09,"end":114.11,"text":"形成向外的成分，能够形成喷流。"},{"start":114.13,"end":118.15,"text":"德国马克斯·普朗克引力物理研究所的达米安娜超级计算机"},{"start":118.17,"end":122.23,"text":"花了六周，才揭示了一个过程的细节，这个过程"},{"start":122.25,"end":126.27,"text":"只在千分之 35 秒内展开。"},{"start":126.29,"end":130.36,"text":"新模拟显示两颗中子星合并，"},{"start":130.38,"end":134.42,"text":"形成一个被超热等离子体包围的黑洞。"},{"start":134.44,"end":138.48,"text":"左边是恒星的密度图，它们的物质被搅成一团致密的、"},{"start":138.5,"end":142.63,"text":"炽热的旋转残骸云。右边是"},{"start":142.65,"end":146.67,"text":"磁场图，蓝色表示磁场强度是"},{"start":146.69,"end":150.72,"text":"太阳的十亿倍。模拟"},{"start":150.74,"end":154.76,"text":"显示物质和磁场有同样的混乱行为。"},{"start":154.78,"end":158.81,"text":"两种结构都逐渐变得更有序，但这里重要的"},{"start":158.83,"end":162.88,"text":"是白色的磁场。在这场难以置信的"},{"start":162.9,"end":166.94,"text":"混乱之中，白色磁场呈现出了喷流的特征，尽管"},{"start":166.96,"end":170.98,"text":"模拟结束时还没有物质流过它。"},{"start":171.0,"end":175.02,"text":"显示磁场突然组织成喷流，"},{"start":175.04,"end":179.07,"text":"给科学家补上了缺失的一环。它证实了"},{"start":179.09,"end":183.13,"text":"合并的中子星确实能产生短伽马射线暴。"},{"start":183.15,"end":187.19,"text":"此刻，在宇宙的某个地方，它又要"},{"start":187.21,"end":191.21,"text":"再次发生了。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":12.46,"end":16.48,"text":"Narrator: Every day or two, on average, satellites detect","words":[["Narrator:","旁白"],["Every","每"],["day","天"],["or","或"],["two,","两"],["on","在"],["average,","平均上"],["satellites","卫星"],["detect","探测到"]]},{"start":16.5,"end":20.55,"text":"a massive explosion somewhere in the sky. These are gamma-ray","words":[["a","一次"],["massive","巨大的"],["explosion","爆炸"],["somewhere","某处"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["sky.","天空"],["These","这些"],["are","是"],["gamma-ray","伽马射线"]]},{"start":20.57,"end":24.62,"text":"bursts, the brightest blasts in the universe. They're thought to be","words":[["bursts,","暴"],["the","这"],["brightest","最亮的"],["blasts","爆发"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["universe.","宇宙"],["They're","它们被"],["thought","认为"],["to","去"],["be","是"]]},{"start":24.64,"end":28.69,"text":"caused by jets of matter moving near the speed of light associated with the births","words":[["caused","造成"],["by","由"],["jets","喷流"],["of","的"],["matter","物质"],["moving","运动"],["near","接近"],["the","这"],["speed","速度"],["of","的"],["light","光"],["associated","相关"],["with","与"],["the","这"],["births","诞生"]]},{"start":28.71,"end":32.75,"text":"of black holes. Gamma-ray bursts that last longer than two seconds","words":[["of","的"],["black","黑"],["holes.","洞"],["Gamma-ray","伽马射线"],["bursts","暴"],["that","那"],["last","持续"],["longer","更长"],["than","比"],["two","两"],["seconds","秒"]]},{"start":32.77,"end":36.83,"text":"are the most common and are thought to result from the death of a massive star.","words":[["are","是"],["the","这"],["most","最"],["common","常见"],["and","和"],["are","被"],["thought","认为"],["to","去"],["result","源于"],["from","来自"],["the","这"],["death","死亡"],["of","的"],["a","一颗"],["massive","大质量"],["star.","恒星"]]},{"start":36.85,"end":41.04,"text":"Shorter bursts proved much more elusive. In fact,","words":[["Shorter","较短"],["bursts","暴"],["proved","证明"],["much","很"],["more","更"],["elusive.","难以捉摸"],["In","事实"],["fact,","上"]]},{"start":41.06,"end":45.06,"text":"even some of their basic properties were unknown until NASA's Swift satellite","words":[["even","甚至"],["some","一些"],["of","的"],["their","它们的"],["basic","基本"],["properties","性质"],["were","曾"],["unknown","未知"],["until","直到"],["NASA's","NASA的"],["Swift","雨燕"],["satellite","卫星"]]},{"start":45.08,"end":49.16,"text":"began work in 2004. Astronomers suspected that crashing","words":[["began","开始"],["work","工作"],["in","在"],["2004.","2004年"],["Astronomers","天文学家"],["suspected","怀疑"],["that","那"],["crashing","相撞的"]]},{"start":49.18,"end":53.21,"text":"neutron stars could explain short bursts.","words":[["neutron","中子"],["stars","星"],["could","能"],["explain","解释"],["short","短"],["bursts.","暴"]]},{"start":53.23,"end":57.31,"text":"A neutron star is what remains when a star several times the mass","words":[["A","一颗"],["neutron","中子"],["star","星"],["is","是"],["what","什么"],["remains","剩下"],["when","当"],["a","一颗"],["star","恒星"],["several","几"],["times","倍"],["the","这"],["mass","质量"]]},{"start":57.33,"end":61.39,"text":"of the sun collapses and explodes. With more than the sun's","words":[["of","的"],["the","这"],["sun","太阳"],["collapses","坍缩"],["and","和"],["explodes.","爆炸"],["With","以"],["more","多"],["than","于"],["the","这"],["sun's","太阳的"]]},{"start":61.41,"end":65.43,"text":"mass packed in a sphere less than 18 miles across, these objects are","words":[["mass","质量"],["packed","塞"],["in","在"],["a","一个"],["sphere","球体"],["less","少"],["than","于"],["18","18"],["miles","英里"],["across,","宽"],["these","这些"],["objects","天体"],["are","是"]]},{"start":65.45,"end":69.51,"text":"incredibly dense. Just a sugar-cube-size piece of neutron star","words":[["incredibly","极其"],["dense.","致密"],["Just","只"],["a","一块"],["sugar-cube-size","方糖大小的"],["piece","块"],["of","的"],["neutron","中子"],["star","星"]]},{"start":69.53,"end":73.56,"text":"can weigh as much as all the water in the Great Lakes. When two","words":[["can","能"],["weigh","重"],["as","一样"],["much","多"],["as","一样"],["all","全部"],["the","这"],["water","水"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Great","五大"],["Lakes.","湖"],["When","当"],["two","两颗"]]},{"start":73.58,"end":77.66,"text":"orbiting neutron stars collide, they merge and form a black hole, releasing","words":[["orbiting","绕转的"],["neutron","中子"],["stars","星"],["collide,","相撞"],["they","它们"],["merge","合并"],["and","和"],["form","形成"],["a","一个"],["black","黑"],["hole,","洞"],["releasing","释放"]]},{"start":77.68,"end":81.68,"text":"enormous amounts of energy in the process. Armed with state-of-the-art","words":[["enormous","巨大的"],["amounts","量"],["of","的"],["energy","能量"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["process.","过程"],["Armed","配备"],["with","有"],["state-of-the-art","最先进的"]]},{"start":81.7,"end":85.7,"text":"supercomputer models, scientists have shown that colliding neutron stars","words":[["supercomputer","超级计算机"],["models,","模型"],["scientists","科学家"],["have","已"],["shown","证明"],["that","那"],["colliding","相撞的"],["neutron","中子"],["stars","星"]]},{"start":85.72,"end":89.76,"text":"can produce the energetic jet required for a gamma-ray burst.","words":[["can","能"],["produce","产生"],["the","这"],["energetic","高能"],["jet","喷流"],["required","所需"],["for","为"],["a","一次"],["gamma-ray","伽马射线"],["burst.","暴"]]},{"start":89.78,"end":93.83,"text":"Earlier simulations demonstrated that mergers could make black holes. Others","words":[["Earlier","早先"],["simulations","模拟"],["demonstrated","证明"],["that","那"],["mergers","合并"],["could","能"],["make","产生"],["black","黑"],["holes.","洞"],["Others","其他"]]},{"start":93.85,"end":97.91,"text":"had shown that the high-speed particle jets needed to make a gamma-ray burst would","words":[["had","曾"],["shown","证明"],["that","那"],["the","这"],["high-speed","高速"],["particle","粒子"],["jets","喷流"],["needed","需要"],["to","去"],["make","产生"],["a","一次"],["gamma-ray","伽马射线"],["burst","暴"],["would","会"]]},{"start":97.93,"end":101.96,"text":"continue if placed in the swirling wreckage of a recent merger.","words":[["continue","持续"],["if","如果"],["placed","放"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["swirling","旋转的"],["wreckage","残骸"],["of","的"],["a","一次"],["recent","最近的"],["merger.","合并"]]},{"start":101.98,"end":106.0,"text":"Now, the simulations reveal the middle step of the process","words":[["Now,","现在"],["the","这"],["simulations","模拟"],["reveal","揭示"],["the","这"],["middle","中间"],["step","步"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["process","过程"]]},{"start":106.02,"end":110.07,"text":"--how the merging stars' magnetic field organizes itself","words":[["--how","—如何"],["the","这"],["merging","合并中的"],["stars'","恒星的"],["magnetic","磁"],["field","场"],["organizes","组织"],["itself","自己"]]},{"start":110.09,"end":114.11,"text":"into outwardly directed components capable of forming a jet.","words":[["into","成"],["outwardly","向外"],["directed","指向的"],["components","成分"],["capable","能够"],["of","的"],["forming","形成"],["a","一个"],["jet.","喷流"]]},{"start":114.13,"end":118.15,"text":"The Damiana supercomputer at Germany's Max Planck Institute for Gravitational","words":[["The","这"],["Damiana","达米安娜"],["supercomputer","超级计算机"],["at","在"],["Germany's","德国的"],["Max","马克斯"],["Planck","普朗克"],["Institute","研究所"],["for","为"],["Gravitational","引力"]]},{"start":118.17,"end":122.23,"text":"Physics needed six weeks to reveal the details of a process that","words":[["Physics","物理"],["needed","需要"],["six","六"],["weeks","周"],["to","去"],["reveal","揭示"],["the","这"],["details","细节"],["of","的"],["a","一个"],["process","过程"],["that","那"]]},{"start":122.25,"end":126.27,"text":"unfolds in just 35 thousandths of a second.","words":[["unfolds","展开"],["in","在"],["just","只"],["35","35"],["thousandths","千分之一"],["of","的"],["a","一"],["second.","秒"]]},{"start":126.29,"end":130.36,"text":"The new simulation shows two neutron stars merging to","words":[["The","这"],["new","新"],["simulation","模拟"],["shows","显示"],["two","两颗"],["neutron","中子"],["stars","星"],["merging","合并"],["to","去"]]},{"start":130.38,"end":134.42,"text":"form a black hole surrounded by super-hot plasma. On","words":[["form","形成"],["a","一个"],["black","黑"],["hole","洞"],["surrounded","包围"],["by","被"],["super-hot","超热"],["plasma.","等离子体"],["On","在"]]},{"start":134.44,"end":138.48,"text":"the left is a map of the density of the stars as they scramble their matter into a dense,","words":[["the","这"],["left","左边"],["is","是"],["a","一张"],["map","图"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["density","密度"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["stars","恒星"],["as","当"],["they","它们"],["scramble","搅"],["their","它们的"],["matter","物质"],["into","成"],["a","一团"],["dense,","致密"]]},{"start":138.5,"end":142.63,"text":"hot cloud of swirling debris. On the right is a map of","words":[["hot","炽热"],["cloud","云"],["of","的"],["swirling","旋转的"],["debris.","残骸"],["On","在"],["the","这"],["right","右边"],["is","是"],["a","一张"],["map","图"],["of","的"]]},{"start":142.65,"end":146.67,"text":"the magnetic fields, with blue representing magnetic strength a billion times","words":[["the","这"],["magnetic","磁"],["fields,","场"],["with","以"],["blue","蓝色"],["representing","表示"],["magnetic","磁"],["strength","强度"],["a","一"],["billion","十亿"],["times","倍"]]},{"start":146.69,"end":150.72,"text":"greater than the sun's. The simulation","words":[["greater","更强"],["than","比"],["the","这"],["sun's.","太阳的"],["The","这"],["simulation","模拟"]]},{"start":150.74,"end":154.76,"text":"shows the same disorderly behavior of the matter and magnetic fields.","words":[["shows","显示"],["the","这"],["same","同样"],["disorderly","无序的"],["behavior","行为"],["of","的"],["the","这"],["matter","物质"],["and","和"],["magnetic","磁"],["fields.","场"]]},{"start":154.78,"end":158.81,"text":"Both structures gradually become more organized, but what's important","words":[["Both","两种"],["structures","结构"],["gradually","逐渐"],["become","变得"],["more","更"],["organized,","有序"],["but","但"],["what's","什么是"],["important","重要"]]},{"start":158.83,"end":162.88,"text":"here is the white magnetic field. Amidst this incredible","words":[["here","这里"],["is","是"],["the","这"],["white","白色"],["magnetic","磁"],["field.","场"],["Amidst","在…之中"],["this","这"],["incredible","难以置信的"]]},{"start":162.9,"end":166.94,"text":"turmoil, the white field has taken on the character of a jet, although","words":[["turmoil,","混乱"],["the","这"],["white","白色"],["field","场"],["has","已"],["taken","呈现"],["on",""],["the","这"],["character","特征"],["of","的"],["a","一个"],["jet,","喷流"],["although","尽管"]]},{"start":166.96,"end":170.98,"text":"no matter is flowing through it when the simulation ends.","words":[["no","没有"],["matter","物质"],["is","是"],["flowing","流动"],["through","穿过"],["it","它"],["when","当"],["the","这"],["simulation","模拟"],["ends.","结束"]]},{"start":171.0,"end":175.02,"text":"Showing that magnetic fields suddenly become organized as jets","words":[["Showing","显示"],["that","那"],["magnetic","磁"],["fields","场"],["suddenly","突然"],["become","变得"],["organized","组织"],["as","作为"],["jets","喷流"]]},{"start":175.04,"end":179.07,"text":"provides scientists with the missing link. It confirms that","words":[["provides","提供"],["scientists","科学家"],["with","以"],["the","这"],["missing","缺失的"],["link.","环节"],["It","它"],["confirms","证实"],["that","那"]]},{"start":179.09,"end":183.13,"text":"merging neutron stars can indeed produce short gamma-ray bursts.","words":[["merging","合并的"],["neutron","中子"],["stars","星"],["can","能"],["indeed","确实"],["produce","产生"],["short","短"],["gamma-ray","伽马射线"],["bursts.","暴"]]},{"start":183.15,"end":187.19,"text":"At this moment, somewhere across the cosmos, it's about","words":[["At","在"],["this","这"],["moment,","时刻"],["somewhere","某处"],["across","遍及"],["the","这"],["cosmos,","宇宙"],["it's","它是"],["about","将要"]]},{"start":187.21,"end":191.21,"text":"to happen again.","words":[["to","去"],["happen","发生"],["again.","再"]]}]}